<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Overdue Invoice</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f9fafb; }
        .overdue-details { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .payment-btn { display: inline-block; background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>⚠️ Overdue Invoice - Action Required</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{tenantName}},</p>
            <p>This is a reminder that you have an overdue invoice. Immediate payment is required to avoid service interruption.</p>
            
            <div class="overdue-details">
                <h3>Overdue Invoice Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Invoice Number:</strong> {{invoiceNumber}}</p>
                <p><strong>Amount Due:</strong> ${{amount}}</p>
                <p><strong>Original Due Date:</strong> {{dueDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Days Overdue:</strong> {{daysOverdue}}</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>Please make payment immediately to avoid:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Late fees and interest charges</li>
                <li>Service suspension</li>
                <li>Impact on your credit standing</li>
            </ul>
            
            <a href="{{paymentUrl}}" class="payment-btn">Pay Overdue Invoice Now</a>
            
            <p>If you have already made payment or have questions about this invoice, please contact our billing department immediately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
